"The table compares the percentages of children who had seven different educational problems in two primary schools in 2005 and 2015.": "",
"Overall, School A had a much higher proportion of children with problems than School B in both years.": "",
"In addition, while most of the figures for School A decreased over the period, those for School B generally rose.": "",
